cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this renderer, cite blueprintUE.
title: blueprintUE render (render.js, render.css), vendored
abstract: >-
  bue-render/render.js and bue-render/render.css are blueprintUE's blueprint
  renderer, copied unmodified from V-Sekai-fire/blueprint-self-hosted
  (www/bue-render) at the commit below; the same files
  goderyu/obsidian-blueprint-renderer wraps as an Obsidian plugin. Local
  adaptations: none to the vendored files. gen_blueprint.py (ours) turns a
  markdown step table, such as issue 5's, into blueprint clipboard text, one
  node per row with its exec pins chained in table order, and writes a page
  that renders it the way blueprintUE's render page does.
authors:
  - name: blueprintUE contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/blueprint-self-hosted
commit: a678b80cc54e01fbaeedb17bb44d3cc2558cd7b4
license: MIT
